From: ykai55 <ykai55@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 03:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Make native renderer release infallible

Prepare release pipeline options while acquire is still protected by
AcquireRollback, before the renderer handle is published. Release preparation
then only validates thread and active state and cannot fail from allocation.

Cover the pre-publication invariant through a narrow C++ test peer, verify
wrong-thread release remains non-consuming, and exercise setup failure after
root creation to prove acquire rolls back root and host ownership.

---
 core/renderer/native_renderer.cc          | 28 +++++++---
 core/renderer/native_renderer_unittest.cc | 64 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 84 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/renderer/native_renderer.cc b/core/renderer/native_renderer.cc
index ebe0b38..b53daac 100644
--- a/core/renderer/native_renderer.cc
+++ b/core/renderer/native_renderer.cc
@@ -40,6 +40,13 @@
 
 namespace lynx {
 namespace tasm {
